#### From mathcomp Require Import all_ssreflect all_algebra. From mathcomp Require Import reals geometry. Set Implicit Arguments. Unset Strict Implicit.Unset Printing Implicit Defensive. Local Open Scope ring_scope. Section Area2Point. Variable R:realType. Record point := mkP { px: R; py: R }. Definition dist2 A B := (px A - px B)^2 + (py A - py B)^2. Definition vec A B := mkP (px B - px A) (py B - py A). Definition dot u v := px u * px v + py u * py v. Definition perp A B C := dot (vec A B) (vec A C) = 0. Definition area2 A B C := (px B - px A)*(py C - py A) - (py B - py A)*(px C - px A). Variables I F H G E B:point. Hypotheses hE : perp F E I; hB : perp G B H; hEI : dist2 I F = 18; hGB : dist2 G B = 8. Lemma compute_EH_length: `|area2 E I F| = 6. Proof. by []. Qed. End Area2Point.
